# AI ruleset (self-hosted)
# Based on blankmagic/surge rule/ai.list, with the Apple Intelligence section removed.
# Apple service domains (Private Relay, Siri, Location, App Store CDN) are handled
# by explicit DIRECT rules in the main config and must not go through proxy.
# Updated: 2026-10-01

